{
  "slug": "pdf-forge",
  "name": "Pdf Forge",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Professional PDF generation with Tailwind CSS. Generates slide presentations (16:9) and A4 documents from any content using a complete design system — typography scales, spacing grids, color palettes, and 15 ready-to-use templates. Renders via Playwright/Chromium. Includes brand customization, anti-AI-sloppy aesthetics (zinc backbone, negative tracking, restrained accents), and an MCP server for Claude Desktop integration.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `pdf-forge` (Create polished PDFs, decks, reports, documents, and social creatives from HTML/Tailwind using the pdf-forge workflow).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pdf-forge@claude-community` from `syx-labs/pdf-forge`.\n\nProfessional PDF generation for AI coding agents. Slides and documents with Vercel/Stripe-quality aesthetics using pure HTML + Tailwind CSS. Works with Warp, Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, Augment Code, Gemini, and more.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
